 35CL3c  were detected using a 55-cm{+3} Ge(Li) detector. Measured reaction     
 35CL4c  yields, E|g, I|g. Deduced 28 resonances, resonance strengths,          
 35CL5c  |g-branching ratios, and 9 lifetimes using DSAM.                       
